  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Links Workshop har som m&#xE5;l att &#xF6;ka intresset f&#xF6;r samarbete mellan svensk och MENA-region forskare inom samh&#xE4;llsvetenskapliga &#xE4;mne som j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet, demokrati och fred.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Links Workshops are aimed at raising the interest for research collaboration between Swedish and MENA region researchers in the area of social sciences, especially in research related to gender and equality issues, democracy and peace and security.</narrative>
  </description>
